   216                          ;; ---- PETSCII <-> screen codes ------------------------------------------------
   217                          ;; code_of_char c : PETSCII character -> screen code. Control codes ($00-$1F,
   218                          ;; $80-$9F) give the space code ($20); $FF (pi) gives $5E.
